[
{
"scene": "01",
"t0": 0.0,
"t1": 1.91,
"text": "You are standing in a river."
},
{
"scene": "01",
"t0": 1.91,
"t1": 2.97,
"text": "The water is warm and brown."
},
{
"scene": "01",
"t0": 2.97,
"t1": 4.04,
"text": "\u2026"
},
{
"scene": "01",
"t0": 4.04,
"t1": 5.91,
"text": "You cannot see your own feet."
},
{
"scene": "01",
"t0": 5.91,
"t1": 7.68,
"text": "The sea is hundreds of kilometres"
},
{
"scene": "01",
"t0": 7.68,
"t1": 9.22,
"text": "away. This should be"
},
{
"scene": "01",
"t0": 9.22,
"t1": 10.72,
"text": "the safest place in the world"
},
{
"scene": "01",
"t0": 10.72,
"t1": 12.31,
"text": "from sharks."
},
{
"scene": "01",
"t0": 12.31,
"t1": 14.14,
"text": "But a few metres away, something"
},
{
"scene": "01",
"t0": 14.14,
"t1": 15.79,
"text": "heavy turns in the murk."
},
{
"scene": "01",
"t0": 15.79,
"t1": 17.56,
"text": "It came in from the ocean, weeks"
},
{
"scene": "01",
"t0": 17.56,
"t1": 18.62,
"text": "ago, and swam upstream."
},
{
"scene": "01",
"t0": 18.62,
"t1": 19.68,
"text": "\u2026"
},
{
"scene": "01",
"t0": 19.68,
"t1": 20.87,
"text": "Past towns."
},
{
"scene": "01",
"t0": 20.87,
"t1": 22.06,
"text": "Past bridges."
},
{
"scene": "01",
"t0": 22.06,
"t1": 23.5,
"text": "All the way to you."
},
{
"scene": "01",
"t0": 23.5,
"t1": 24.82,
"text": "It is a bull shark."
},
{
"scene": "01",
"t0": 24.82,
"t1": 26.5,
"text": "And it is one of the very few sharks"
},
{
"scene": "01",
"t0": 26.5,
"t1": 27.7,
"text": "on Earth that can live in fresh water."
},
{
"scene": "01",
"t0": 27.7,
"t1": 28.91,
"text": "\u2026"
},
{
"scene": "01",
"t0": 28.91,
"t1": 30.55,
"text": "So what happens when a bull shark"
},
{
"scene": "01",
"t0": 30.55,
"t1": 32.03,
"text": "follows you upriver?"
},
{
"scene": "01",
"t0": 32.03,
"t1": 33.69,
"text": "On the way, you will find out"
},
{
"scene": "01",
"t0": 33.69,
"t1": 35.44,
"text": "how a sea shark survives in fresh"
},
{
"scene": "01",
"t0": 35.44,
"t1": 37.05,
"text": "water. How it finds you"
},
{
"scene": "01",
"t0": 37.05,
"t1": 38.91,
"text": "in water you cannot see through."
},
{
"scene": "01",
"t0": 38.91,
"t1": 40.6,
"text": "And the farthest from the sea a bull"
},
{
"scene": "01",
"t0": 40.6,
"t1": 42.21,
"text": "shark has ever been found."
},
{
"scene": "02",
"t0": 0.0,
"t1": 1.8,
"text": "Bull sharks are not the biggest"
},
{
"scene": "02",
"t0": 1.8,
"t1": 3.45,
"text": "sharks. Most adults"
},
{
"scene": "02",
"t0": 3.45,
"t1": 5.25,
"text": "are two to three metres long."
},
{
"scene": "02",
"t0": 5.25,
"t1": 6.88,
"text": "Big females can grow to around"
},
{
"scene": "02",
"t0": 6.88,
"t1": 8.09,
"text": "three and a half."
},
{
"scene": "02",
"t0": 8.09,
"t1": 9.65,
"text": "But they are built heavy."
},
{
"scene": "02",
"t0": 9.65,
"t1": 11.62,
"text": "A short, wide, blunt"
},
{
"scene": "02",
"t0": 11.62,
"t1": 12.64,
"text": "snout. Small eyes."
},
{
"scene": "02",
"t0": 12.64,
"t1": 13.66,
"text": "\u2026"
},
{
"scene": "02",
"t0": 13.66,
"t1": 14.79,
"text": "A thick body, like a boxer."
},
{
"scene": "02",
"t0": 14.79,
"t1": 15.93,
"text": "\u2026"
},
{
"scene": "02",
"t0": 15.93,
"t1": 17.84,
"text": "They are named for that snout,"
},
{
"scene": "02",
"t0": 17.84,
"t1": 19.57,
"text": "and for the way they head-butt their prey"
},
{
"scene": "02",
"t0": 19.57,
"t1": 21.11,
"text": "before they bite."
},
{
"scene": "02",
"t0": 21.11,
"t1": 22.65,
"text": "Around the world, they go"
},
{
"scene": "02",
"t0": 22.65,
"t1": 24.02,
"text": "by many names."
},
{
"scene": "02",
"t0": 24.02,
"t1": 25.81,
"text": "In southern Africa, people"
},
{
"scene": "02",
"t0": 25.81,
"t1": 27.79,
"text": "call it the Zambezi shark,"
},
{
"scene": "02",
"t0": 27.79,
"t1": 29.35,
"text": "after the great river it swims"
},
{
"scene": "02",
"t0": 29.35,
"t1": 31.27,
"text": "up. In Central America,"
},
{
"scene": "02",
"t0": 31.27,
"t1": 33.17,
"text": "it was once called the Lake Nicaragua"
},
{
"scene": "02",
"t0": 33.17,
"t1": 34.85,
"text": "shark. They live along"
},
{
"scene": "02",
"t0": 34.85,
"t1": 36.01,
"text": "warm coasts all around the world."
},
{
"scene": "02",
"t0": 36.01,
"t1": 37.17,
"text": "\u2026"
},
{
"scene": "02",
"t0": 37.17,
"t1": 39.13,
"text": "In bays, harbours,"
},
{
"scene": "02",
"t0": 39.13,
"t1": 41.08,
"text": "lagoons and river mouths."
},
{
"scene": "02",
"t0": 41.08,
"t1": 42.97,
"text": "Places where people swim."
},
{
"scene": "02",
"t0": 42.97,
"t1": 44.05,
"text": "And unlike almost every other shark,"
},
{
"scene": "02",
"t0": 44.05,
"t1": 45.14,
"text": "\u2026"
},
{
"scene": "02",
"t0": 45.14,
"t1": 46.15,
"text": "they do not stop at the coast."
},
{
"scene": "02",
"t0": 46.15,
"t1": 47.15,
"text": "\u2026"
},
{
"scene": "03",
"t0": 0.0,
"t1": 1.51,
"text": "To understand why this is so"
},
{
"scene": "03",
"t0": 1.51,
"t1": 3.15,
"text": "strange, you need to know one"
},
{
"scene": "03",
"t0": 3.15,
"t1": 4.8,
"text": "thing about sharks."
},
{
"scene": "03",
"t0": 4.8,
"t1": 6.59,
"text": "A shark's body is full of salt"
},
{
"scene": "03",
"t0": 6.59,
"t1": 8.01,
"text": "and other chemicals."
},
{
"scene": "03",
"t0": 8.01,
"t1": 9.64,
"text": "In the sea, that matches the"
},
{
"scene": "03",
"t0": 9.64,
"t1": 10.9,
"text": "water around it."
},
{
"scene": "03",
"t0": 10.9,
"t1": 12.84,
"text": "Nothing leaks in or out."
},
{
"scene": "03",
"t0": 12.84,
"t1": 14.43,
"text": "But in fresh water, the"
},
{
"scene": "03",
"t0": 14.43,
"t1": 15.6,
"text": "outside has almost no salt."
},
{
"scene": "03",
"t0": 15.6,
"t1": 16.76,
"text": "\u2026"
},
{
"scene": "03",
"t0": 16.76,
"t1": 18.35,
"text": "Water floods into the shark's"
},
{
"scene": "03",
"t0": 18.35,
"t1": 19.4,
"text": "body through its gills and skin,"
},
{
"scene": "03",
"t0": 19.4,
"t1": 20.44,
"text": "\u2026"
},
{
"scene": "03",
"t0": 20.44,
"t1": 22.4,
"text": "trying to even things out."
},
{
"scene": "03",
"t0": 22.4,
"t1": 23.96,
"text": "Its blood thins."
},
{
"scene": "03",
"t0": 23.96,
"t1": 25.83,
"text": "Its cells swell."
},
{
"scene": "03",
"t0": 25.83,
"t1": 27.47,
"text": "For most sharks, a river"
},
{
"scene": "03",
"t0": 27.47,
"t1": 29.03,
"text": "is a slow poison."
},
{
"scene": "03",
"t0": 29.03,
"t1": 30.72,
"text": "That is why you almost never see them"
},
{
"scene": "03",
"t0": 30.72,
"t1": 32.39,
"text": "there. The bull shark"
},
{
"scene": "03",
"t0": 32.39,
"t1": 33.78,
"text": "has solved that problem."
},
{
"scene": "04",
"t0": 0.0,
"t1": 1.63,
"text": "When a bull shark swims from"
},
{
"scene": "04",
"t0": 1.63,
"t1": 3.32,
"text": "the sea into a river, its"
},
{
"scene": "04",
"t0": 3.32,
"t1": 4.77,
"text": "body changes."
},
{
"scene": "04",
"t0": 4.77,
"t1": 5.87,
"text": "Its kidneys go into overdrive."
},
{
"scene": "04",
"t0": 5.87,
"t1": 6.97,
"text": "\u2026"
},
{
"scene": "04",
"t0": 6.97,
"t1": 8.62,
"text": "They pump out huge amounts of"
},
{
"scene": "04",
"t0": 8.62,
"t1": 9.65,
"text": "very weak, watery urine,"
},
{
"scene": "04",
"t0": 9.65,
"t1": 10.68,
"text": "\u2026"
},
{
"scene": "04",
"t0": 10.68,
"t1": 12.19,
"text": "getting rid of the extra water"
},
{
"scene": "04",
"t0": 12.19,
"t1": 13.21,
"text": "as fast as it comes in."
},
{
"scene": "04",
"t0": 13.21,
"t1": 14.22,
"text": "\u2026"
},
{
"scene": "04",
"t0": 14.22,
"t1": 16.1,
"text": "At the same time, its kidneys"
},
{
"scene": "04",
"t0": 16.1,
"t1": 17.63,
"text": "hold on to salt, pulling it"
},
{
"scene": "04",
"t0": 17.63,
"t1": 19.27,
"text": "back into the blood instead of losing"
},
{
"scene": "04",
"t0": 19.27,
"t1": 21.19,
"text": "it. And a special gland"
},
{
"scene": "04",
"t0": 21.19,
"t1": 23.08,
"text": "that normally dumps extra salt,"
},
{
"scene": "04",
"t0": 23.08,
"t1": 24.79,
"text": "the rectal gland, slows"
},
{
"scene": "04",
"t0": 24.79,
"t1": 26.63,
"text": "down. In fresh water,"
},
{
"scene": "04",
"t0": 26.63,
"t1": 27.77,
"text": "there is no extra salt to dump."
},
{
"scene": "04",
"t0": 27.77,
"t1": 28.91,
"text": "\u2026"
},
{
"scene": "04",
"t0": 28.91,
"t1": 30.49,
"text": "Its blood ends up less salty"
},
{
"scene": "04",
"t0": 30.49,
"t1": 31.96,
"text": "than it is in the sea."
},
{
"scene": "04",
"t0": 31.96,
"t1": 33.03,
"text": "But never as watery as the river."
},
{
"scene": "04",
"t0": 33.03,
"t1": 34.11,
"text": "\u2026"
},
{
"scene": "04",
"t0": 34.11,
"t1": 35.75,
"text": "The shark keeps itself somewhere"
},
{
"scene": "04",
"t0": 35.75,
"t1": 37.28,
"text": "in between, balanced"
},
{
"scene": "04",
"t0": 37.28,
"t1": 38.65,
"text": "on a knife edge."
},
{
"scene": "04",
"t0": 38.65,
"t1": 40.28,
"text": "It is not effortless."
},
{
"scene": "04",
"t0": 40.28,
"t1": 42.28,
"text": "It costs the shark energy."
},
{
"scene": "04",
"t0": 42.28,
"t1": 43.52,
"text": "But it works."
},
{
"scene": "04",
"t0": 43.52,
"t1": 45.19,
"text": "And it opens up a whole world"
},
{
"scene": "04",
"t0": 45.19,
"t1": 47.18,
"text": "that other sharks cannot reach."
},
{
"scene": "05",
"t0": 0.0,
"t1": 1.72,
"text": "So why do it?"
},
{
"scene": "05",
"t0": 1.72,
"t1": 3.23,
"text": "Many bull sharks are born in"
},
{
"scene": "05",
"t0": 3.23,
"t1": 4.95,
"text": "rivers and estuaries."
},
{
"scene": "05",
"t0": 4.95,
"t1": 6.95,
"text": "Pregnant females swim into brackish"
},
{
"scene": "05",
"t0": 6.95,
"t1": 8.55,
"text": "water to give birth, and"
},
{
"scene": "05",
"t0": 8.55,
"t1": 9.64,
"text": "the young stay there for years."
},
{
"scene": "05",
"t0": 9.64,
"t1": 10.73,
"text": "\u2026"
},
{
"scene": "05",
"t0": 10.73,
"t1": 12.17,
"text": "It is a nursery."
},
{
"scene": "05",
"t0": 12.17,
"t1": 13.73,
"text": "The water is murky,"
},
{
"scene": "05",
"t0": 13.73,
"t1": 15.33,
"text": "full of fish, and most"
},
{
"scene": "05",
"t0": 15.33,
"t1": 16.88,
"text": "of the big sharks that might eat"
},
{
"scene": "05",
"t0": 16.88,
"t1": 18.39,
"text": "a young bull shark will"
},
{
"scene": "05",
"t0": 18.39,
"t1": 19.46,
"text": "not follow it inside."
},
{
"scene": "05",
"t0": 19.46,
"t1": 20.54,
"text": "\u2026"
},
{
"scene": "05",
"t0": 20.54,
"t1": 22.15,
"text": "Scientists who tag young bull"
},
{
"scene": "05",
"t0": 22.15,
"t1": 23.88,
"text": "sharks in rivers often"
},
{
"scene": "05",
"t0": 23.88,
"t1": 25.55,
"text": "find them staying in the same few"
},
{
"scene": "05",
"t0": 25.55,
"t1": 26.65,
"text": "kilometres of river for months,"
},
{
"scene": "05",
"t0": 26.65,
"t1": 27.75,
"text": "\u2026"
},
{
"scene": "05",
"t0": 27.75,
"t1": 29.4,
"text": "moving up and down with the tide"
},
{
"scene": "05",
"t0": 29.4,
"t1": 31.33,
"text": "and the salt, hiding in the brown"
},
{
"scene": "05",
"t0": 31.33,
"t1": 32.53,
"text": "water."
},
{
"scene": "05",
"t0": 32.53,
"t1": 34.06,
"text": "As they grow, the young move"
},
{
"scene": "05",
"t0": 34.06,
"t1": 35.52,
"text": "further out to sea."
},
{
"scene": "05",
"t0": 35.52,
"t1": 37.05,
"text": "But the river stays part of their"
},
{
"scene": "05",
"t0": 37.05,
"t1": 38.58,
"text": "world for life."
},
{
"scene": "05",
"t0": 38.58,
"t1": 40.19,
"text": "And the water they grow up in"
},
{
"scene": "05",
"t0": 40.19,
"t1": 41.85,
"text": "is exactly the kind of water where"
},
{
"scene": "05",
"t0": 41.85,
"t1": 43.62,
"text": "people wade, wash,"
},
{
"scene": "05",
"t0": 43.62,
"t1": 44.93,
"text": "fish and swim."
},
{
"scene": "06",
"t0": 0.0,
"t1": 1.63,
"text": "Back in the river."
},
{
"scene": "06",
"t0": 1.63,
"t1": 3.37,
"text": "You cannot see more than a hand's"
},
{
"scene": "06",
"t0": 3.37,
"t1": 4.96,
"text": "length into the water."
},
{
"scene": "06",
"t0": 4.96,
"t1": 6.44,
"text": "Neither can the shark."
},
{
"scene": "06",
"t0": 6.44,
"t1": 8.09,
"text": "But it does not need to."
},
{
"scene": "06",
"t0": 8.09,
"t1": 9.62,
"text": "Along each side of its body"
},
{
"scene": "06",
"t0": 9.62,
"t1": 10.73,
"text": "runs a line of sensitive pores,"
},
{
"scene": "06",
"t0": 10.73,
"t1": 11.84,
"text": "\u2026"
},
{
"scene": "06",
"t0": 11.84,
"t1": 13.2,
"text": "the lateral line."
},
{
"scene": "06",
"t0": 13.2,
"t1": 14.35,
"text": "It feels movement in the water."
},
{
"scene": "06",
"t0": 14.35,
"t1": 15.5,
"text": "\u2026"
},
{
"scene": "06",
"t0": 15.5,
"t1": 17.05,
"text": "The splash of your feet."
},
{
"scene": "06",
"t0": 17.05,
"t1": 18.85,
"text": "The kick of your legs."
},
{
"scene": "06",
"t0": 18.85,
"t1": 20.52,
"text": "Its nostrils can pick up blood"
},
{
"scene": "06",
"t0": 20.52,
"t1": 21.94,
"text": "and body fluids in tiny"
},
{
"scene": "06",
"t0": 21.94,
"t1": 23.06,
"text": "amounts."
},
{
"scene": "06",
"t0": 23.06,
"t1": 24.76,
"text": "And in the skin of its snout"
},
{
"scene": "06",
"t0": 24.76,
"t1": 26.36,
"text": "are hundreds of jelly-filled"
},
{
"scene": "06",
"t0": 26.36,
"t1": 27.86,
"text": "pores. They sense"
},
{
"scene": "06",
"t0": 27.86,
"t1": 29.48,
"text": "the faint electric fields given"
},
{
"scene": "06",
"t0": 29.48,
"t1": 31.4,
"text": "off by every living muscle."
},
{
"scene": "06",
"t0": 31.4,
"t1": 32.97,
"text": "Including yours."
},
{
"scene": "06",
"t0": 32.97,
"t1": 34.47,
"text": "Those pores are among the most"
},
{
"scene": "06",
"t0": 34.47,
"t1": 36.25,
"text": "sensitive electric sensors in the animal"
},
{
"scene": "06",
"t0": 36.25,
"t1": 37.82,
"text": "world. They can pick up"
},
{
"scene": "06",
"t0": 37.82,
"t1": 39.36,
"text": "fields of just a few billionths"
},
{
"scene": "06",
"t0": 39.36,
"t1": 40.9,
"text": "of a volt across a centimetre"
},
{
"scene": "06",
"t0": 40.9,
"t1": 41.91,
"text": "of water."
},
{
"scene": "06",
"t0": 41.91,
"t1": 43.63,
"text": "Every beat of your heart,"
},
{
"scene": "06",
"t0": 43.63,
"t1": 45.16,
"text": "every twitch of your legs,"
},
{
"scene": "06",
"t0": 45.16,
"t1": 46.85,
"text": "sends out a tiny signal."
},
{
"scene": "06",
"t0": 46.85,
"t1": 48.43,
"text": "And in the dark brown water,"
},
{
"scene": "06",
"t0": 48.43,
"t1": 50.0,
"text": "the shark is reading it."
},
{
"scene": "07",
"t0": 0.0,
"t1": 1.5,
"text": "This is the danger"
},
{
"scene": "07",
"t0": 1.5,
"t1": 3.15,
"text": "of murky water."
},
{
"scene": "07",
"t0": 3.15,
"t1": 4.97,
"text": "To a bull shark hunting in a brown"
},
{
"scene": "07",
"t0": 4.97,
"t1": 6.63,
"text": "river, a splashing foot"
},
{
"scene": "07",
"t0": 6.63,
"t1": 8.17,
"text": "and a struggling fish can feel"
},
{
"scene": "07",
"t0": 8.17,
"t1": 9.4,
"text": "very similar."
},
{
"scene": "07",
"t0": 9.4,
"t1": 10.5,
"text": "It cannot take a long look first."
},
{
"scene": "07",
"t0": 10.5,
"t1": 11.59,
"text": "\u2026"
},
{
"scene": "07",
"t0": 11.59,
"t1": 13.18,
"text": "So sometimes, it simply"
},
{
"scene": "07",
"t0": 13.18,
"t1": 15.0,
"text": "tests the shape with a bump,"
},
{
"scene": "07",
"t0": 15.0,
"t1": 16.36,
"text": "or a bite."
},
{
"scene": "07",
"t0": 16.36,
"t1": 18.05,
"text": "That is why most bites from bull"
},
{
"scene": "07",
"t0": 18.05,
"t1": 19.65,
"text": "sharks happen in places just"
},
{
"scene": "07",
"t0": 19.65,
"t1": 20.67,
"text": "like this."
},
{
"scene": "07",
"t0": 20.67,
"t1": 21.91,
"text": "Murky water."
},
{
"scene": "07",
"t0": 21.91,
"t1": 23.13,
"text": "River mouths."
},
{
"scene": "07",
"t0": 23.13,
"t1": 24.65,
"text": "Harbours. Often after"
},
{
"scene": "07",
"t0": 24.65,
"t1": 26.25,
"text": "heavy rain, when rivers"
},
{
"scene": "07",
"t0": 26.25,
"t1": 27.77,
"text": "pour brown water and dead"
},
{
"scene": "07",
"t0": 27.77,
"t1": 29.27,
"text": "fish into the sea, and"
},
{
"scene": "07",
"t0": 29.27,
"t1": 30.98,
"text": "the sharks come in to feed."
},
{
"scene": "08",
"t0": 0.0,
"t1": 1.65,
"text": "So the first thing you may feel"
},
{
"scene": "08",
"t0": 1.65,
"t1": 2.95,
"text": "is not a bite."
},
{
"scene": "08",
"t0": 2.95,
"t1": 4.19,
"text": "It is a bump."
},
{
"scene": "08",
"t0": 4.19,
"t1": 5.86,
"text": "A hard knock against your leg"
},
{
"scene": "08",
"t0": 5.86,
"t1": 7.63,
"text": "or your side, from that blunt"
},
{
"scene": "08",
"t0": 7.63,
"t1": 8.73,
"text": "snout."
},
{
"scene": "08",
"t0": 8.73,
"t1": 10.35,
"text": "Bull sharks often bump what they are"
},
{
"scene": "08",
"t0": 10.35,
"t1": 11.75,
"text": "curious about."
},
{
"scene": "08",
"t0": 11.75,
"t1": 13.46,
"text": "It may be how they feel out whether"
},
{
"scene": "08",
"t0": 13.46,
"t1": 15.08,
"text": "something is food, and whether it"
},
{
"scene": "08",
"t0": 15.08,
"t1": 16.32,
"text": "fights back."
},
{
"scene": "08",
"t0": 16.32,
"t1": 17.92,
"text": "If you are lucky, it swims"
},
{
"scene": "08",
"t0": 17.92,
"t1": 19.88,
"text": "away. But sometimes,"
},
{
"scene": "08",
"t0": 19.88,
"t1": 21.42,
"text": "the bump comes first and"
},
{
"scene": "08",
"t0": 21.42,
"t1": 23.04,
"text": "the bite comes next."
},
{
"scene": "09",
"t0": 0.0,
"t1": 1.55,
"text": "A bull shark's jaws"
},
{
"scene": "09",
"t0": 1.55,
"t1": 2.94,
"text": "are built for big,"
},
{
"scene": "09",
"t0": 2.94,
"t1": 4.51,
"text": "struggling prey."
},
{
"scene": "09",
"t0": 4.51,
"t1": 6.08,
"text": "The lower teeth are narrow and"
},
{
"scene": "09",
"t0": 6.08,
"t1": 7.88,
"text": "pointed, to hold."
},
{
"scene": "09",
"t0": 7.88,
"t1": 9.58,
"text": "The upper teeth are wide,"
},
{
"scene": "09",
"t0": 9.58,
"t1": 11.54,
"text": "triangular and serrated,"
},
{
"scene": "09",
"t0": 11.54,
"t1": 12.61,
"text": "to cut."
},
{
"scene": "09",
"t0": 12.61,
"t1": 14.53,
"text": "A fork and a knife."
},
{
"scene": "09",
"t0": 14.53,
"t1": 15.54,
"text": "In 2012, scientists"
},
{
"scene": "09",
"t0": 15.54,
"t1": 16.54,
"text": "\u2026"
},
{
"scene": "09",
"t0": 16.54,
"t1": 18.5,
"text": "compared the bite force of thirteen"
},
{
"scene": "09",
"t0": 18.5,
"t1": 19.58,
"text": "kinds of sharks and rays."
},
{
"scene": "09",
"t0": 19.58,
"t1": 20.66,
"text": "\u2026"
},
{
"scene": "09",
"t0": 20.66,
"t1": 22.21,
"text": "For its body size, the"
},
{
"scene": "09",
"t0": 22.21,
"t1": 23.82,
"text": "bull shark had the strongest bite"
},
{
"scene": "09",
"t0": 23.82,
"t1": 24.84,
"text": "of them all."
},
{
"scene": "09",
"t0": 24.84,
"t1": 25.84,
"text": "Stronger, pound for pound,"
},
{
"scene": "09",
"t0": 25.84,
"t1": 26.85,
"text": "\u2026"
},
{
"scene": "09",
"t0": 26.85,
"t1": 28.47,
"text": "than a great white."
},
{
"scene": "09",
"t0": 28.47,
"t1": 30.02,
"text": "For a big bull shark,"
},
{
"scene": "09",
"t0": 30.02,
"t1": 31.59,
"text": "the team calculated a bite at"
},
{
"scene": "09",
"t0": 31.59,
"t1": 33.23,
"text": "the back of the jaw of nearly"
},
{
"scene": "09",
"t0": 33.23,
"t1": 35.15,
"text": "six thousand newtons."
},
{
"scene": "09",
"t0": 35.15,
"t1": 36.77,
"text": "Like the weight of about six hundred"
},
{
"scene": "09",
"t0": 36.77,
"t1": 38.43,
"text": "kilograms, pressing down"
},
{
"scene": "09",
"t0": 38.43,
"t1": 39.49,
"text": "on a few square centimetres."
},
{
"scene": "09",
"t0": 39.49,
"t1": 40.55,
"text": "\u2026"
},
{
"scene": "09",
"t0": 40.55,
"t1": 42.15,
"text": "Bull sharks are one of the three"
},
{
"scene": "09",
"t0": 42.15,
"t1": 43.88,
"text": "sharks behind most serious"
},
{
"scene": "09",
"t0": 43.88,
"t1": 45.77,
"text": "unprovoked bites on people,"
},
{
"scene": "09",
"t0": 45.77,
"t1": 47.64,
"text": "along with the great white and the tiger"
},
{
"scene": "09",
"t0": 47.64,
"t1": 48.2,
"text": "shark."
},
{
"scene": "10",
"t0": 0.0,
"t1": 0.94,
"text": "In February"
},
{
"scene": "10",
"t0": 0.94,
"t1": 2.58,
"text": "2009, a"
},
{
"scene": "10",
"t0": 2.58,
"t1": 3.6,
"text": "Navy diver called Paul de Gelder"
},
{
"scene": "10",
"t0": 3.6,
"t1": 4.61,
"text": "\u2026"
},
{
"scene": "10",
"t0": 4.61,
"t1": 5.69,
"text": "was in the water in Sydney Harbour,"
},
{
"scene": "10",
"t0": 5.69,
"t1": 6.77,
"text": "\u2026"
},
{
"scene": "10",
"t0": 6.77,
"t1": 8.46,
"text": "taking part in a training exercise"
},
{
"scene": "10",
"t0": 8.46,
"t1": 9.66,
"text": "at dawn."
},
{
"scene": "10",
"t0": 9.66,
"t1": 11.25,
"text": "A bull shark, more than two"
},
{
"scene": "10",
"t0": 11.25,
"t1": 12.99,
"text": "and a half metres long, came"
},
{
"scene": "10",
"t0": 12.99,
"t1": 14.72,
"text": "up from below and bit him."
},
{
"scene": "10",
"t0": 14.72,
"t1": 16.32,
"text": "It took his right hand and"
},
{
"scene": "10",
"t0": 16.32,
"t1": 17.83,
"text": "his right leg."
},
{
"scene": "10",
"t0": 17.83,
"t1": 19.81,
"text": "His team pulled him from the water."
},
{
"scene": "10",
"t0": 19.81,
"t1": 21.38,
"text": "He survived, and went on to"
},
{
"scene": "10",
"t0": 21.38,
"t1": 22.94,
"text": "become a campaigner for protecting"
},
{
"scene": "10",
"t0": 22.94,
"t1": 24.02,
"text": "sharks."
},
{
"scene": "10",
"t0": 24.02,
"t1": 25.85,
"text": "The harbour he was in was not a remote"
},
{
"scene": "10",
"t0": 25.85,
"t1": 27.37,
"text": "river. It was the middle of"
},
{
"scene": "10",
"t0": 27.37,
"t1": 28.52,
"text": "one of the biggest cities in Australia."
},
{
"scene": "10",
"t0": 28.52,
"t1": 29.68,
"text": "\u2026"
},
{
"scene": "10",
"t0": 29.68,
"t1": 31.2,
"text": "Bull sharks still swim there"
},
{
"scene": "10",
"t0": 31.2,
"t1": 32.1,
"text": "every summer."
},
{
"scene": "11",
"t0": 0.0,
"t1": 1.5,
"text": "And bull sharks have turned"
},
{
"scene": "11",
"t0": 1.5,
"t1": 2.59,
"text": "up in some very unlikely places."
},
{
"scene": "11",
"t0": 2.59,
"t1": 3.68,
"text": "\u2026"
},
{
"scene": "11",
"t0": 3.68,
"t1": 5.33,
"text": "In Central America, sharks"
},
{
"scene": "11",
"t0": 5.33,
"t1": 7.15,
"text": "were found in Lake Nicaragua,"
},
{
"scene": "11",
"t0": 7.15,
"t1": 9.05,
"text": "a huge freshwater lake."
},
{
"scene": "11",
"t0": 9.05,
"t1": 10.58,
"text": "For years, people thought they were"
},
{
"scene": "11",
"t0": 10.58,
"t1": 11.7,
"text": "a separate, trapped species."
},
{
"scene": "11",
"t0": 11.7,
"t1": 12.82,
"text": "\u2026"
},
{
"scene": "11",
"t0": 12.82,
"t1": 14.57,
"text": "In the late"
},
{
"scene": "11",
"t0": 14.57,
"t1": 16.24,
"text": "1960s, scientists tagged more than two"
},
{
"scene": "11",
"t0": 16.24,
"t1": 17.81,
"text": "thousand of them, and proved they"
},
{
"scene": "11",
"t0": 17.81,
"t1": 19.51,
"text": "were bull sharks swimming up and down"
},
{
"scene": "11",
"t0": 19.51,
"t1": 21.04,
"text": "the San Juan River, through"
},
{
"scene": "11",
"t0": 21.04,
"t1": 22.71,
"text": "its rapids, between the lake"
},
{
"scene": "11",
"t0": 22.71,
"t1": 23.82,
"text": "and the sea."
},
{
"scene": "11",
"t0": 23.82,
"t1": 25.35,
"text": "In 1937,"
},
{
"scene": "11",
"t0": 25.35,
"t1": 27.06,
"text": "two fishermen pulled a bull shark"
},
{
"scene": "11",
"t0": 27.06,
"t1": 28.75,
"text": "out of the Mississippi River at"
},
{
"scene": "11",
"t0": 28.75,
"t1": 30.28,
"text": "Alton, Illinois."
},
{
"scene": "11",
"t0": 30.28,
"t1": 31.79,
"text": "More than a thousand kilometres"
},
{
"scene": "11",
"t0": 31.79,
"t1": 32.97,
"text": "from the sea."
},
{
"scene": "11",
"t0": 32.97,
"t1": 34.5,
"text": "And in Australia, after a"
},
{
"scene": "11",
"t0": 34.5,
"t1": 36.23,
"text": "flood in the"
},
{
"scene": "11",
"t0": 36.23,
"t1": 37.77,
"text": "1990s, six bull sharks ended"
},
{
"scene": "11",
"t0": 37.77,
"t1": 39.36,
"text": "up in a lake on a golf course"
},
{
"scene": "11",
"t0": 39.36,
"t1": 40.66,
"text": "near Brisbane."
},
{
"scene": "11",
"t0": 40.66,
"t1": 42.55,
"text": "They lived there for well over a decade,"
},
{
"scene": "11",
"t0": 42.55,
"t1": 44.15,
"text": "watched by golfers, until"
},
{
"scene": "11",
"t0": 44.15,
"t1": 45.4,
"text": "they disappeared."
},
{
"scene": "11",
"t0": 45.4,
"t1": 47.01,
"text": "Floods like that are part of the"
},
{
"scene": "11",
"t0": 47.01,
"t1": 48.58,
"text": "bull shark's world."
},
{
"scene": "11",
"t0": 48.58,
"t1": 50.12,
"text": "Every time a big hurricane or"
},
{
"scene": "11",
"t0": 50.12,
"t1": 51.65,
"text": "flood hits, photos"
},
{
"scene": "11",
"t0": 51.65,
"t1": 53.32,
"text": "of sharks swimming down flooded"
},
{
"scene": "11",
"t0": 53.32,
"t1": 54.91,
"text": "streets go viral."
},
{
"scene": "11",
"t0": 54.91,
"t1": 56.74,
"text": "Almost all of them are fakes."
},
{
"scene": "11",
"t0": 56.74,
"t1": 58.7,
"text": "But the golf course was real."
},
{
"scene": "11",
"t0": 58.7,
"t1": 60.67,
"text": "When rivers burst their banks,"
},
{
"scene": "11",
"t0": 60.67,
"t1": 62.43,
"text": "bull sharks can go where the water"
},
{
"scene": "11",
"t0": 62.43,
"t1": 63.22,
"text": "goes."
},
{
"scene": "12",
"t0": 0.0,
"t1": 1.25,
"text": "But the record is in South America."
},
{
"scene": "12",
"t0": 1.25,
"t1": 2.49,
"text": "\u2026"
},
{
"scene": "12",
"t0": 2.49,
"t1": 4.14,
"text": "Bull sharks have been found far up"
},
{
"scene": "12",
"t0": 4.14,
"t1": 5.69,
"text": "the Amazon, at Iquitos"
},
{
"scene": "12",
"t0": 5.69,
"t1": 6.82,
"text": "in Peru."
},
{
"scene": "12",
"t0": 6.82,
"t1": 8.67,
"text": "That is around four thousand kilometres"
},
{
"scene": "12",
"t0": 8.67,
"t1": 10.25,
"text": "from the Atlantic Ocean."
},
{
"scene": "12",
"t0": 10.25,
"t1": 11.82,
"text": "Further than the distance from London"
},
{
"scene": "12",
"t0": 11.82,
"t1": 13.76,
"text": "to Cairo, in fresh water,"
},
{
"scene": "12",
"t0": 13.76,
"t1": 15.01,
"text": "against the current, all the way."
},
{
"scene": "12",
"t0": 15.01,
"t1": 16.26,
"text": "\u2026"
},
{
"scene": "12",
"t0": 16.26,
"t1": 17.99,
"text": "Iquitos sits more than a hundred"
},
{
"scene": "12",
"t0": 17.99,
"t1": 19.58,
"text": "metres above sea level."
},
{
"scene": "12",
"t0": 19.58,
"t1": 21.2,
"text": "To get there, the shark had to"
},
{
"scene": "12",
"t0": 21.2,
"t1": 22.51,
"text": "swim uphill."
},
{
"scene": "12",
"t0": 22.51,
"t1": 23.58,
"text": "For weeks."
},
{
"scene": "12",
"t0": 23.58,
"t1": 25.15,
"text": "Through one of the biggest rivers on"
},
{
"scene": "12",
"t0": 25.15,
"t1": 26.25,
"text": "the planet."
},
{
"scene": "12",
"t0": 26.25,
"t1": 27.81,
"text": "A sea shark, swimming"
},
{
"scene": "12",
"t0": 27.81,
"t1": 28.93,
"text": "in the heart of the rainforest."
},
{
"scene": "12",
"t0": 28.93,
"t1": 30.05,
"text": "\u2026"
},
{
"scene": "12",
"t0": 30.05,
"t1": 31.55,
"text": "And the Amazon is not the"
},
{
"scene": "12",
"t0": 31.55,
"t1": 33.41,
"text": "only great river it climbs."
},
{
"scene": "12",
"t0": 33.41,
"t1": 35.15,
"text": "In southern Africa, bull sharks"
},
{
"scene": "12",
"t0": 35.15,
"t1": 36.68,
"text": "swim up the Zambezi."
},
{
"scene": "12",
"t0": 36.68,
"t1": 38.44,
"text": "In Australia, they live far"
},
{
"scene": "12",
"t0": 38.44,
"t1": 40.25,
"text": "up the rivers of Queensland and the Northern"
},
{
"scene": "12",
"t0": 40.25,
"t1": 41.98,
"text": "Territory. Anywhere a warm"
},
{
"scene": "12",
"t0": 41.98,
"t1": 43.57,
"text": "river meets a warm sea,"
},
{
"scene": "12",
"t0": 43.57,
"t1": 45.27,
"text": "the bull shark may be waiting."
},
{
"scene": "13",
"t0": 0.0,
"t1": 1.65,
"text": "So, what should you do"
},
{
"scene": "13",
"t0": 1.65,
"t1": 3.18,
"text": "if you are ever in water where bull"
},
{
"scene": "13",
"t0": 3.18,
"t1": 4.54,
"text": "sharks live?"
},
{
"scene": "13",
"t0": 4.54,
"t1": 6.08,
"text": "Most of it is about not being there"
},
{
"scene": "13",
"t0": 6.08,
"t1": 7.38,
"text": "at the wrong time."
},
{
"scene": "13",
"t0": 7.38,
"t1": 9.35,
"text": "Avoid swimming in murky water,"
},
{
"scene": "13",
"t0": 9.35,
"t1": 10.88,
"text": "in river mouths, and in"
},
{
"scene": "13",
"t0": 10.88,
"t1": 12.58,
"text": "harbours, especially at"
},
{
"scene": "13",
"t0": 12.58,
"t1": 14.23,
"text": "dawn, at dusk, and"
},
{
"scene": "13",
"t0": 14.23,
"t1": 15.59,
"text": "after heavy rain."
},
{
"scene": "13",
"t0": 15.59,
"t1": 17.48,
"text": "Do not swim near people fishing,"
},
{
"scene": "13",
"t0": 17.48,
"t1": 19.26,
"text": "or near anything bleeding."
},
{
"scene": "13",
"t0": 19.26,
"t1": 20.81,
"text": "Take off shiny jewellery,"
},
{
"scene": "13",
"t0": 20.81,
"t1": 22.46,
"text": "which can flash like the scales of"
},
{
"scene": "13",
"t0": 22.46,
"t1": 23.75,
"text": "a fish."
},
{
"scene": "13",
"t0": 23.75,
"t1": 25.58,
"text": "And stay with other people."
},
{
"scene": "13",
"t0": 25.58,
"t1": 27.28,
"text": "A shark is more likely to approach"
},
{
"scene": "13",
"t0": 27.28,
"t1": 28.53,
"text": "someone alone."
},
{
"scene": "13",
"t0": 28.53,
"t1": 29.69,
"text": "If you see a shark, do not splash."
},
{
"scene": "13",
"t0": 29.69,
"t1": 30.85,
"text": "\u2026"
},
{
"scene": "13",
"t0": 30.85,
"t1": 32.61,
"text": "Keep it in sight, and move"
},
{
"scene": "13",
"t0": 32.61,
"t1": 34.21,
"text": "calmly towards the shore or the"
},
{
"scene": "13",
"t0": 34.21,
"t1": 35.76,
"text": "boat. And if it does"
},
{
"scene": "13",
"t0": 35.76,
"t1": 37.53,
"text": "bite, fight back."
},
{
"scene": "13",
"t0": 37.53,
"t1": 39.15,
"text": "Hit the eyes and the gills,"
},
{
"scene": "13",
"t0": 39.15,
"t1": 40.97,
"text": "the most sensitive parts."
},
{
"scene": "13",
"t0": 40.97,
"t1": 42.57,
"text": "Most sharks that bite people"
},
{
"scene": "13",
"t0": 42.57,
"t1": 43.47,
"text": "let go."
},
{
"scene": "14",
"t0": 0.0,
"t1": 1.5,
"text": "But the danger mostly runs the"
},
{
"scene": "14",
"t0": 1.5,
"t1": 2.5,
"text": "other way."
},
{
"scene": "14",
"t0": 2.5,
"t1": 4.13,
"text": "For every person bitten by a bull"
},
{
"scene": "14",
"t0": 4.13,
"t1": 5.78,
"text": "shark, huge numbers of bull"
},
{
"scene": "14",
"t0": 5.78,
"t1": 7.44,
"text": "sharks are caught by people."
},
{
"scene": "14",
"t0": 7.44,
"t1": 9.32,
"text": "For their meat, their fins,"
},
{
"scene": "14",
"t0": 9.32,
"t1": 10.44,
"text": "their skin and their liver oil."
},
{
"scene": "14",
"t0": 10.44,
"t1": 11.55,
"text": "\u2026"
},
{
"scene": "14",
"t0": 11.55,
"t1": 13.05,
"text": "The rivers and estuaries where bull"
},
{
"scene": "14",
"t0": 13.05,
"t1": 14.64,
"text": "sharks are born are some of the"
},
{
"scene": "14",
"t0": 14.64,
"t1": 15.64,
"text": "most damaged waters on Earth."
},
{
"scene": "14",
"t0": 15.64,
"t1": 16.65,
"text": "\u2026"
},
{
"scene": "14",
"t0": 16.65,
"t1": 17.95,
"text": "Dams block them."
},
{
"scene": "14",
"t0": 17.95,
"t1": 19.02,
"text": "Pollution and building fill them."
},
{
"scene": "14",
"t0": 19.02,
"t1": 20.1,
"text": "\u2026"
},
{
"scene": "14",
"t0": 20.1,
"t1": 21.25,
"text": "Nets and lines catch the young."
},
{
"scene": "14",
"t0": 21.25,
"t1": 22.4,
"text": "\u2026"
},
{
"scene": "14",
"t0": 22.4,
"t1": 23.45,
"text": "Bull sharks are listed as vulnerable,"
},
{
"scene": "14",
"t0": 23.45,
"t1": 24.51,
"text": "\u2026"
},
{
"scene": "14",
"t0": 24.51,
"t1": 26.09,
"text": "and in many places their numbers"
},
{
"scene": "14",
"t0": 26.09,
"t1": 27.19,
"text": "have fallen."
},
{
"scene": "14",
"t0": 27.19,
"t1": 28.82,
"text": "The odds of a bull shark biting"
},
{
"scene": "14",
"t0": 28.82,
"t1": 30.01,
"text": "you are tiny."
},
{
"scene": "14",
"t0": 30.01,
"t1": 31.59,
"text": "The odds of people harming a bull"
},
{
"scene": "14",
"t0": 31.59,
"t1": 33.1,
"text": "shark are not."
},
{
"scene": "15",
"t0": 0.0,
"t1": 1.56,
"text": "So what happens when a bull"
},
{
"scene": "15",
"t0": 1.56,
"t1": 3.55,
"text": "shark follows you upriver?"
},
{
"scene": "15",
"t0": 3.55,
"t1": 4.56,
"text": "Most of the time, nothing."
},
{
"scene": "15",
"t0": 4.56,
"t1": 5.57,
"text": "\u2026"
},
{
"scene": "15",
"t0": 5.57,
"t1": 7.21,
"text": "It feels your legs move,"
},
{
"scene": "15",
"t0": 7.21,
"t1": 8.89,
"text": "decides you are not a fish,"
},
{
"scene": "15",
"t0": 8.89,
"t1": 10.45,
"text": "and turns away into the brown"
},
{
"scene": "15",
"t0": 10.45,
"t1": 12.09,
"text": "water. You never even"
},
{
"scene": "15",
"t0": 12.09,
"t1": 13.46,
"text": "know it was there."
},
{
"scene": "15",
"t0": 13.46,
"t1": 15.06,
"text": "Because that is the strangest thing"
},
{
"scene": "15",
"t0": 15.06,
"t1": 16.47,
"text": "about the bull shark."
},
{
"scene": "15",
"t0": 16.47,
"t1": 18.21,
"text": "It is not hunting you."
},
{
"scene": "15",
"t0": 18.21,
"t1": 19.79,
"text": "Most of the time, it is just"
},
{
"scene": "15",
"t0": 19.79,
"t1": 21.62,
"text": "living its life in a place we never"
},
{
"scene": "15",
"t0": 21.62,
"t1": 23.5,
"text": "expected a shark to be."
},
{
"scene": "15",
"t0": 23.5,
"t1": 24.68,
"text": "But it was."
},
{
"scene": "15",
"t0": 24.68,
"t1": 26.26,
"text": "A sea shark, hundreds of"
},
{
"scene": "15",
"t0": 26.26,
"t1": 27.95,
"text": "kilometres from the sea, in"
},
{
"scene": "15",
"t0": 27.95,
"t1": 29.89,
"text": "water that should have killed it."
},
{
"scene": "15",
"t0": 29.89,
"t1": 31.73,
"text": "And the next time you stand in a warm,"
},
{
"scene": "15",
"t0": 31.73,
"t1": 33.38,
"text": "brown river, you will wonder"
},
{
"scene": "15",
"t0": 33.38,
"t1": 34.45,
"text": "what is moving just past your feet."
},
{
"scene": "15",
"t0": 34.45,
"t1": 35.53,
"text": "\u2026"
}
]